134 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 106 0 R /E(The Blood Bank Inventory and Repository System is a software application designed to manage blood donations, maintain blood stock records, and help identify suitable blood donors during emergencies. The system stores important information such as donor details, blood groups, available blood units, donation dates, and stock availability. It helps blood banks efficiently manage their inventory, reduce manual record-keeping, and retrieve information quickly when required. The system also supports searching for compatible blood groups and tracking blood stock levels to ensure better availability of blood for patients in need.)/Pg 11 0 R /K[ 0]>>
endobj
