<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 120 0 R /E(The Blood Bank Inventory and Repository System provides an efficient and organized way to manage blood donors, blood stock, and blood requests. By using Java programming concepts such as arrays, classes, objects, inheritance, exception handling, file handling, and collections, the system helps maintain records, track blood availability, and process requests systematically. It reduces manual effort, improves data accuracy, and supports faster access to essential information during emergencies. Overall, this project demonstrates how technology can improve blood bank management and contribute to the timely availability of blood for patients in need.)/Pg 25 0 R /K[ 0]>>
